{"id":"8ffdd76172ba4225","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-scott-domain.md","title":"Scott Domain","display":"df-scott-domain — Scott Domain","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-scott-domain","aliases":["58-df-scott-domain","Scott Domain"],"display":"df-scott-domain — Scott Domain","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-cpo.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-algebraic-lattice.md]]","[[58-df-bounding]]","[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-scott-domain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-scott-domain</span><span>Scott Domain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-scott-domain — Scott Domain"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d2e0e7710413332a\" href=\"?note=d2e0e7710413332a\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-cpo.md\">../batch20/58-df-cpo.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"331ebd81d6d8c956\" href=\"?note=331ebd81d6d8c956\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-algebraic-lattice.md\">../batch02/58-df-algebraic-lattice.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"68353af5ed159f6f\" href=\"?note=68353af5ed159f6f\" title=\"58-df-bounding\">58-df-bounding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(D,\\leq)\">\\((D,\\leq)\\)</span> (partially ordered set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in D\">\\(\\bot\\in D\\)</span> (least-element candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_{D,\\leq}\">\\(K_{D,\\leq}\\)</span> (compact elements defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Directed}\">\\(\\operatorname{Directed}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedAbove}_{D,\\leq}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedAbove}_{D,\\leq}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LUB}_{D,\\leq}\">\\(\\mathrm{LUB}_{D,\\leq}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Countable}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Countable}_S\\)</span> (order predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ScottDomain}(D,\\leq)\">\\(\\operatorname{ScottDomain}(D,\\leq)\\)</span> (Scott-domain predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}scott\\text{-}domain\\text{-}compact\\text{-}elements} \\vdash K_{D,\\leq}\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{k\\in D:\\forall A\\subseteq D\\;\\forall s\\in D\\;\\bigl((A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\operatorname{Directed}(A,\\leq)\\land\\mathrm{LUB}_{D,\\leq}(A,s)\\land k\\leq s)\\to\\exists a\\in A\\;(k\\leq a)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}scott\\text{-}domain\\text{-}compact\\text{-}elements} \\vdash K_{D,\\leq}\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{k\\in D:\\forall A\\subseteq D\\;\\forall s\\in D\\;\\bigl((A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\operatorname{Directed}(A,\\leq)\\land\\mathrm{LUB}_{D,\\leq}(A,s)\\land k\\leq s)\\to\\exists a\\in A\\;(k\\leq a)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}scott\\text{-}domain} \\vdash \\operatorname{ScottDomain}(D,\\leq) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Poset}(D,\\leq)\\land\\bot\\in D\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;(\\bot\\leq x)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq D\\;((A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\operatorname{Directed}(A,\\leq))\\to\\exists s\\in D\\;\\mathrm{LUB}_{D,\\leq}(A,s))\\land\\forall A\\subseteq D\\;(\\mathrm{BoundedAbove}_{D,\\leq}(A)\\to\\exists s\\in D\\;\\mathrm{LUB}_{D,\\leq}(A,s))\\land\\operatorname{Countable}_S(K_{D,\\leq})\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;\\mathrm{LUB}_{D,\\leq}(\\{k\\in K_{D,\\leq}:k\\leq x\\},x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}scott\\text{-}domain} \\vdash \\operatorname{ScottDomain}(D,\\leq) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Poset}(D,\\leq)\\land\\bot\\in D\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;(\\bot\\leq x)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq D\\;((A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\operatorname{Directed}(A,\\leq))\\to\\exists s\\in D\\;\\mathrm{LUB}_{D,\\leq}(A,s))\\land\\forall A\\subseteq D\\;(\\mathrm{BoundedAbove}_{D,\\leq}(A)\\to\\exists s\\in D\\;\\mathrm{LUB}_{D,\\leq}(A,s))\\land\\operatorname{Countable}_S(K_{D,\\leq})\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;\\mathrm{LUB}_{D,\\leq}(\\{k\\in K_{D,\\leq}:k\\leq x\\},x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This convention takes a Scott domain to be a pointed, bounded-complete, countably based algebraic dcpo.</li>\n<li>Function space: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[D \\to E]\">\\([D \\to E]\\)</span> inherits CPO structure via pointwise order</li>\n<li>Scott topology: continuous functions are precisely those preserving directed suprema</li>\n<li>Universal domain: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\infty}\">\\(D_{\\infty}\\)</span> contains approximations of all computable functions</li>\n<li>Stable functions: additional boundedness property; models stable PCF</li>\n<li>Applications: domain theory, denotational semantics, computability</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Abramsky and Jung, Domain Theory</li>\n<li>Winskel, The Formal Semantics of Programming Languages</li>\n<li>Gunter, Semantics of Programming Languages</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-cpo.md","status":"resolved","id":"d2e0e7710413332a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-cpo.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-algebraic-lattice.md","status":"resolved","id":"331ebd81d6d8c956","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-algebraic-lattice.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bounding","status":"resolved","id":"68353af5ed159f6f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bounding]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(D,\\leq)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"K_{D,\\leq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Directed}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedAbove}_{D,\\leq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LUB}_{D,\\leq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Countable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ScottDomain}(D,\\leq)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}scott\\text{-}domain\\text{-}compact\\text{-}elements} \\vdash K_{D,\\leq}\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{k\\in D:\\forall A\\subseteq D\\;\\forall s\\in D\\;\\bigl((A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\operatorname{Directed}(A,\\leq)\\land\\mathrm{LUB}_{D,\\leq}(A,s)\\land k\\leq s)\\to\\exists a\\in A\\;(k\\leq a)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}scott\\text{-}domain} \\vdash \\operatorname{ScottDomain}(D,\\leq) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Poset}(D,\\leq)\\land\\bot\\in D\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;(\\bot\\leq x)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq D\\;((A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\operatorname{Directed}(A,\\leq))\\to\\exists s\\in D\\;\\mathrm{LUB}_{D,\\leq}(A,s))\\land\\forall A\\subseteq D\\;(\\mathrm{BoundedAbove}_{D,\\leq}(A)\\to\\exists s\\in D\\;\\mathrm{LUB}_{D,\\leq}(A,s))\\land\\operatorname{Countable}_S(K_{D,\\leq})\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;\\mathrm{LUB}_{D,\\leq}(\\{k\\in K_{D,\\leq}:k\\leq x\\},x)","display":true},{"tex":"[D \\to E]","display":false},{"tex":"D_{\\infty}","display":false}],"bytes":2229,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-339","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-scott-domain]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1118","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-scott-domain.md|58-df-scott-domain]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["d2e0e7710413332a","331ebd81d6d8c956","68353af5ed159f6f","1b3610e6aed65b25"]}